            "title": "How do I clean my Koozi products?",
            "text": "<p><strong>Bed Covers and Sofa Topper covers: </strong> Machine wash on low-temperature gentle cycle. Line dry</p><p><strong>Waterproof liners:</strong> Hand-wash with warm soapy water. Line dry. </p><p><strong>Marble Bowl Set:</strong> Hand-wash with warm soapy water. Be careful with handling when washing, as this is a delicate item made from natural marble. <br/><br/><strong>Mattress Foam: </strong>Spot clean<br/><br/><strong>The Side Table Crate: </strong>Mild multi-purpose spray and wipe. </p>"
          }
