        "text_638xg3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What can I do to prevent my dog from chewing or damaging the product?",
            "text": "<p>Our products are designed for durability, but they're not made to endure heavy chewing or destructive behaviour. Damage caused from faulty use or from dog behaviour, falls outside of our warranty coverage. <br/><br/>To help prolong the life of your product, we recommend supervising your dog during initial use. If you're concerned about chewing, we offer helpful tips on the product page, including suggestions for using anti-chew sprays, natural lemon and other preventative measures.</p>"
